{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"What format would you like for your video?","box":[45,-2376,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"1. Video language: English\n2. Captions: Yes, include captions","box":[365,-2298,670,200],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a drama based on this template — give me a moment...","box":[45,-2030,990,110],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-1864,990,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-1739,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"【The New CEO】\nJulian announces that he will personally oversee the arts foundation and recruits Lauren after overhearing her criticism.\n\n【The Same Vision】\nLauren realizes Julian genuinely wants to support artists, and their shared purpose creates their first flirtatious moment.\n\n【After Hours】\nJulian remembers Lauren’s coffee order and reveals that the foundation was the dream of his late mother, a public-school art teacher.\n\n【Building It Together】\nWhile adjusting a painting’s position, Julian and Lauren move increasingly close and can no longer ignore their attraction.\n\n【More Than the Foundation】\nJulian admits that he wants more time with Lauren and promises to ask her out after the opening.\n\n【The Final Question】\nAfter dedicating the foundation to his mother and publicly thanking Lauren, Julian asks her on a date, and she accepts.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Julian Cross — handsome American CEO in his early thirties; outwardly controlled and demanding, privately earnest, attentive, and awkward with romance.\n• Lauren Hale — capable American junior arts-foundation coordinator in her late twenties; overlooked but confident, thoughtful, and willing to challenge authority.\n• Host — polished adult American event host who briefly introduces Julian at the employee gathering.","box":[90,-1654,900,2147],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":41,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,586,900,40],"color":"#FFCCD5E1","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"Julian Cross","box":[90,930,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Lauren Hale","box":[372,930,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Host","box":[654,930,248,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"The language is already set to English.","box":[45,1083,990,53],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Create storyboard","box":[635,1161,400,143],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I have created the six-beat storyboard for The Art of Falling, tracing Julian and Lauren's journey from corporate tension to their final date invitation.","box":[45,1372,990,167],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"The characters look great! Ready to create the storyboard?","box":[45,1595,990,92],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_chips_lead","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Create storyboard","box":[113,1755,854,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":700,"style":"bold","family":null,"lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_title","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Credits will be consumed for this task.","box":[113,1807,854,40],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_description","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"37","box":[158,1911,34,37],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":31,"sp":11.02,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit_confirm_cost","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Generate","box":[717,1881,250,96],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":700,"style":"bold","family":null,"lines":1,"id":"id/button_mini_drama_credit_confirm","window":0,"res":"@color/statusWhite"},{"text":"28523","box":[605,132,110,46],"color":"#FFFFFFFF","px":39,"sp":